950">won't </span><span begin="01:00.950" end="01:01.310">let </span><span begin="01:01.310" end="01:01.880">you </span><span begin="01:01.880" end="01:02.630">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.660" end="01:07.730"><span begin="01:02.660" end="01:03.260">he </span><span begin="01:03.260" end="01:04.220">messed </span><span begin="01:04.220" end="01:04.580">me </span><span begin="01:04.580" end="01:05.420">up</span><span begin="01:05.420" end="01:05.420">, </span><span begin="01:05.420" end="01:05.870">need </span><span begin="01:05.870" end="01:05.960">a </span><span begin="01:05.960" end="01:06.710">second </span><span begin="01:06.710" end="01:07.040">to </span><span begin="01:07.040" end="01:07.730">breathe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.940" end="01:10.850"><span begin="01:07.940" end="01:08.390">Just </span><span begin="01:08.390" end="01:08.660">keep </span><span begin="01:08.660" end="01:09.440">coming </span><span begin="01:09.440" end="01:10.850">around</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.880" end="01:14.060"><span begin="01:10.880" end="01:11.780">Hey</span><span begin="01:11.780" end="01:11.810">, </span><span begin="01:11.810" end="01:12.140">what </span><span begin="01:12.140" end="01:12.200">do </span><span begin="01:12.200" end="01:12.440">you </span><span begin="01:12.440" end="01:12.680">want </span><span begin="01:12.680" end="01:12.890">from </span><span begin="01:12.890" end="01:14.060">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.330" end="01:16.730"><span begin="01:14.330" end="01:14.720">What </span><span begin="01:14.720" end="01:14.780">do </span><span begin="01:14.780" end="01:14.930">you </span><span begin="01:14.930" end="01:15.290">want </span><span begin="01:15.290" end="01:15.500">from </span><span begin="01:15.500" end="01:16.730">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.940" end="01:19.670"><span begin="01:16.940" end="01:17.300">What </span><span begin="01:17.300" end="01:17.360">do </span><span begin="0